sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as HUD (MC_Workshop_Link)
    participant W as WS (Workshop / HUD-spool / Output)

    Note over H: IDLE (non associé)
    Note over W: FREE

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over H,W: Association
    W-->>W: touch → OFFERED
    W->>H: OFFER | kind | single | keep | dev
    Note over H: BINDING
    H->>W: ACCEPT | owner | kind
    Note over W: BOUND
    W->>H: BOUND
    Note over H: IDLE (associé)
    end

    rect rgb(235,255,240)
    Note over H,W: Préparation
    Note over H: choose() → GESTURE → SNAPSHOT (local)
    H->>W: BEGIN | choice | gesture[ | heat]
    Note over H: WAIT_BEGIN
    W-->>W: map inputs (Config) → RECEIVING
    W->>H: ACK | BEGIN
    Note over H: ROWS
    end

    rect rgb(255,250,230)
    Note over H,W: Upload des sources (stop-and-wait)
    loop pour chaque row (seq = 0..N-1)
        H->>W: ROW | seq | src | qty | HERE
        Note over H: WAIT_ROW
        W-->>W: store row (idempotent)
        W->>H: ACK | ROW | seq
        Note over H: ROWS (++seq)
    end
    H->>W: END | count
    Note over H: WAIT_RESULT
    end

    rect rgb(245,240,255)
    Note over H,W: Évaluation → produit
    Note over W: BUILDING → EVALUATING
    W-->>W: Eval (STORED) → Output START
    Note over W: OUTPUT → SETTLING
    W->>H: RESULT | OK
    Note over H: SETTLING
    H-->>H: COMPLETE (local) → CRAFT_DONE
    H->>W: CLOSED
    Note over W: PRODUCT (ws:closed) → finishProduct
    Note over H: OUTPUT (si CONTAINER)<br/>ou IDLE (don / KEEP)
    end

    rect rgb(255,240,245)
    Note over H,W: Collecte du produit (CONTAINER)
    loop tant que produit en attente
        H->>W: OUTPUT_STATUS (timer 10s)
        W->>H: OUTPUT_STATE | run | phase | reste | dna
        H->>W: TRANSFER | ticket | container
        Note over H: WAIT_TRANSFER
        W-->>W: Output deliver → CONFIG container
        W->>H: OUTPUT_REPLY | TRANSFERRED | ticket | qty
        Note over H: OUTPUT
    end
    W->>H: OUTPUT_CLOSED
    Note over H: IDLE (restoreIngredients)
    Note over W: BOUND
    end

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
    Note over H,W: Chemins alternatifs
    alt refus / erreur workshop
        W->>H: RESULT | NO | reason
        Note over H: abort → IDLE (ingrédients conservés)
    else annulation avant END
        H->>W: ABORT
        Note over W: BOUND (RECEIVING/BUILDING annulé)
    else sortie de session
        W->>H: EXIT_REQUEST
        H->>W: EXIT
        W->>H: RELEASED
        Note over H: session effacée
        Note over W: FREE
    end
    end
